  <jpcrp_cor:ClassIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc contextRef="FilingDateInstant_OrdinaryShareMember">普通株式</jpcrp_cor:ClassIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfFinancialInstrumentsExchangeOnWhichSecuritiesAreListedOrAuthorizedFinancialInstrumentsBusinessAssociationToWhichSecuritiesAreRegistered contextRef="FilingDateInstant_OrdinaryShareMember">東京証券取引所 スタンダード市場</jpcrp_cor:NameOfFinancialInstrumentsExchangeOnWhichSecuritiesAreListedOrAuthorizedFinancialInstrumentsBusinessAssociationToWhichSecuritiesAreRegistered>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc contextRef="FilingDateInstant_OrdinaryShareMember">完全議決権株式であり、権利内容に何ら限定のない当社の標準となる株式で、単元株式数は100株であります。</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc>
  <jpcrp_cor:DetailsOfEmployeeShareOptionProgramTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
